OL,3,GNEWSAThree injured during 'large fight'
OL,4,Ain city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after three
OL,7,Fpeople were injured during a "large
OL,8,Ffight" in a city centre, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe fight happened on Calenick Street
OL,12,Fin Truro at about 13:45 BST, with armed
OL,13,Fofficers dispatched to the scene after
OL,14,Freports a "bladed article" was used,
OL,15,FDevon and Cornwall Police said.
OL,17,FThe force said one man suffered "a
OL,18,Fpotentially serious injury" while two
OL,19,Fother men had minor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
